const A2 = [
 ["During planting, I usually start at six and check the seed drill every morning. During harvest, I start at five and check the combine twice a day. I normally work in the eastern fields during planting, but I spend more time near the storage area during harvest.", "planting=plantio|harvest=colheita|seed drill=semeadora|combine=colheitadeira|twice=duas vezes|storage=armazenamento", "Durante o plantio, verifico a semeadora todas as manhãs.", "During planting, I check the seed drill every morning."],
 ["Ana is checking a pipe now. Paulo is opening a valve. Water is flowing into the field. We normally inspect the system before sunrise. We usually close these valves at noon.", "pipe=tubo|valve=válvula|flow=fluir|normally=normalmente|inspect=inspecionar|sunrise=nascer do sol", "Paulo está abrindo uma válvula agora. Normalmente verificamos o sistema cedo.", "Paulo is opening a valve now. We normally check the system early."],
 ["In August, we are going to collect soil samples. In September, we are going to prepare the field. In October, we are going to plant the crop. In November, we are going to check the young plants.", "collect=coletar|sample=amostra|prepare=preparar|field=talhão|young plants=plantas jovens|season=safra", "Vamos coletar amostras de solo em agosto.", "We are going to collect soil samples in August."],
 ["Plant A has green leaves and a firm stem. Plant B has yellow leaves and brown spots. Some leaves are curling. These are observations. I don't know the cause, so I need more information before making a diagnosis.", "leaf=folha|stem=caule|spot=mancha|curl=enrolar|firm=firme|cause=causa", "A planta tem folhas amarelas e manchas marrons.", "The plant has yellow leaves and brown spots."],
 ["Tractor A costs 120,000 reais, weighs 2 tonnes, uses 5 litres per hour and pulls 3 tonnes. Tractor B costs 180,000 reais, weighs 3 tonnes, uses 7 litres per hour and pulls 5 tonnes. A is cheaper and lighter than B. A uses less fuel, but B can pull a heavier load.", "cheaper=mais barato|lighter=mais leve|fuel=combustível|load=carga|weigh=pesar|cost=custar", "O trator A é mais barato e mais leve que o trator B.", "Tractor A is cheaper and lighter than tractor B."],
 ["Last season, we bought new seed in September. We prepared the field in October. We planted in November. We checked the crop in January. We harvested in March and sold the grain in April.", "bought=compramos|seed=semente|planted=plantamos|harvested=colhemos|sold=vendemos|grain=grão", "Compramos sementes em setembro e plantamos em novembro.", "We bought seed in September and planted in November."],
 ["Ana was checking the pipe when the pump stopped. Paulo was driving to the field when it started to rain. Maria was writing the report when the manager called.", "pump=bomba|stop=parar|rain=chover|call=ligar|when=quando|report=relatório", "Ana estava verificando o tubo quando a bomba parou.", "Ana was checking the pipe when the pump stopped."],
 ["From the gate, go straight to the barn. Turn left at the barn and follow the road to the office. To reach the pond, go straight from the gate, pass the barn and turn right at the large tree.", "straight=em frente|turn=vire|left=esquerda|right=direita|past=passando por|gate=porteira", "Vá em frente e vire à esquerda no galpão.", "Go straight and turn left at the barn."],
 ["Could I borrow your moisture meter, please? Of course. Do you need it today? Yes, until three. Would you like some help with loading? Yes, please. Could you carry these empty boxes?", "borrow=pegar emprestado|moisture meter=medidor de umidade|until=até|loading=carregamento|carry=carregar|offer=oferta", "Eu poderia pegar seu medidor de umidade emprestado?", "Could I borrow your moisture meter?"],
 ["Follow the site's written safety instructions. You must keep the storage door locked. You must wear the required protective equipment. You mustn't eat in the storage area. You mustn't enter without authorization. You have to report damaged containers to the supervisor.", "locked=trancado|protective equipment=equipamento de proteção|authorization=autorização|damaged=danificado|container=recipiente|report=informar", "Você não pode comer na área de armazenamento.", "You mustn't eat in the storage area."],
 ["Ana can operate the tractor. Paulo can repair the irrigation pump. Maria can use the moisture meter. We might rent another tractor. We may ask a contractor for help, but neither option is confirmed.", "operate=operar|repair=consertar|rent=alugar|contractor=prestador de serviço|confirmed=confirmado|option=opção", "Podemos alugar outro trator, mas isso não está confirmado.", "We might rent another tractor, but that isn't confirmed."],
 ["Yesterday, I visited a dairy farm near Lavras. There were two barns and a small office. The team milked the cows twice a day. They recorded the milk volume every morning. The buildings were clean. I liked the clear records and the calm animals.", "dairy farm=fazenda leiteira|milked=ordenhavam|twice=duas vezes|volume=volume|records=registros|calm=calmo", "Havia dois galpões. A equipe ordenhava as vacas duas vezes ao dia.", "There were two barns. The team milked the cows twice a day."],
 ["Have you ever worked on a dairy farm? Yes, I have. Have you used a soil sampler? Yes, I have. Have you driven a combine? No, I haven't. I have worked in agriculture for five years, and I have lived in Lavras since 2021.", "ever=alguma vez|for=há / por (duração)|since=desde|soil sampler=amostrador de solo|experience=experiência|combine=colheitadeira", "Trabalho na agricultura há cinco anos.", "I have worked in agriculture for five years."],
 ["The team has already replaced the filter. Ana has just checked the pump. We haven't repaired the pipe yet. Paulo hasn't ordered the new valve yet.", "already=já|just=acabar de|yet=ainda|replace=substituir|filter=filtro|order=encomendar", "Já substituímos o filtro, mas ainda não consertamos o tubo.", "We have already replaced the filter, but we haven't repaired the pipe yet."],
 ["Follow the sampling plan provided by your agronomist. First, identify the separate sampling areas. Next, prepare clean sampling tools and bags. Collect subsamples at the prescribed depth and locations. Combine the subsamples for each area as instructed. Put the required portion in a clean bag. Finally, label the bag with the area, date and sample identification.", "sampling plan=plano de amostragem|depth=profundidade|subsample=subamostra|combine=misturar|label=etiquetar|area=área", "Rotule o saco com a área, a data e a identificação da amostra.", "Label the bag with the area, date and sample identification."],
 ["You should record which leaves are yellow because the pattern may be useful. You should check recent watering and field records because several problems can look similar. You should ask a qualified professional to inspect the plants before choosing a treatment. You shouldn't assume a diagnosis from leaf colour alone.", "yellowing=amarelecimento|pattern=padrão|watering=rega|qualified=qualificado|treatment=tratamento|assume=presumir", "Você deveria verificar os registros antes de escolher um tratamento.", "You should check the records before choosing a treatment."],
 ["The team meeting starts at seven on Monday. The truck arrives at nine on Tuesday. The forecast shows rain on Wednesday, so the field may be wet. We think the harvest will finish on Friday if the weather stays dry.", "meeting=reunião|arrives=chega|forecast=previsão|scheduled=agendado|prediction=previsão / prognóstico|finish=terminar", "O caminhão chega às nove na terça-feira. Achamos que vai chover.", "The truck arrives at nine on Tuesday. We think it will rain."],
 ["The seed delivery is late. I'll call the supplier now. I'll tell the manager before noon. I'll send you the revised delivery time this afternoon.", "late=atrasado|supplier=fornecedor|before=antes de|revised=revisado|delivery=entrega|this afternoon=hoje à tarde", "Vou ligar para o fornecedor agora e avisar o gerente antes do meio-dia.", "I'll call the supplier now and tell the manager before noon."],
 ["The irrigation pump stopped yesterday at ten. We have checked the electrical supply and replaced the damaged filter. The pump still doesn't start. We have called the maintenance team, but they haven't arrived yet.", "electrical supply=alimentação elétrica|damaged=danificado|still=ainda|maintenance=manutenção|arrive=chegar|malfunction=falha", "Já verificamos a alimentação elétrica, mas a bomba ainda não funciona.", "We have already checked the electrical supply, but the pump still doesn't work."],
 ["We use this meter to measure grain moisture. This bucket is for carrying water. These gloves are for protecting our hands. We use this scale to weigh samples. This label is for identifying the sample.", "measure=medir|moisture=umidade|protect=proteger|scale=balança|weigh=pesar|identify=identificar", "Usamos esta balança para pesar amostras.", "We use this scale to weigh samples."],
 ["We have twenty pairs of gloves, so we have enough. We don't have any empty bags. We have some water, but not much. There aren't many labels left. We need ten more labels and five empty bags.", "enough=suficiente|empty=vazio|left=restante|label=etiqueta|more=mais|inventory=estoque", "Não temos sacos vazios. Precisamos de mais dez etiquetas.", "We don't have any empty bags. We need ten more labels."],
 ["There is a road across the valley. Two fields are beside the road. A river runs behind the fields. The farm buildings are on the hill. A small forest is between the buildings and the river.", "valley=vale|beside=ao lado de|river=rio|hill=morro|forest=floresta|across=atravessando", "Há um rio atrás dos campos e uma floresta no morro.", "There is a river behind the fields and a forest on the hill."],
 ["In this practice case, hand weeding costs 400 reais per hectare, takes 20 labour hours and controls 80% of weeds. Mechanical weeding costs 600 reais, takes 6 hours and controls 90%. Hand weeding is cheaper but slower. Mechanical weeding is more effective here but has a higher cost. Both require trained work and appropriate site checks. I prefer mechanical weeding for this large field because time is limited.", "hand weeding=capina manual|labour=mão de obra|effective=eficaz|slower=mais lento|higher=mais alto|limited=limitado", "A capina manual é mais barata, mas mais lenta.", "Hand weeding is cheaper but slower."],
 ["We were irrigating the eastern field when the pump stopped. First, we shut down the system according to the site procedure. Then we called maintenance. They found a damaged connection and repaired it. We checked the system before starting it again. By the afternoon, irrigation was working normally.", "shut down=desligar|connection=conexão|damaged=danificado|maintenance=manutenção|again=novamente|normally=normalmente", "Estávamos irrigando quando a bomba parou.", "We were irrigating when the pump stopped."],
];
const B1 = [
 ["I studied agronomy from 2016 to 2020. I joined a coffee cooperative in 2021, where I organized field visits for two seasons. Since 2023, I have worked with a small extension team. I have prepared farmer training sessions and improved our visit records. These experiences would help me coordinate your field programme because I understand both practical work and clear reporting.", "cooperative=cooperativa|extension=extensão rural|field visit=visita de campo|reporting=elaboração de relatórios|joined=entrei para|coordinate=coordenar", "Trabalho com uma equipe de extensão desde 2023.", "I have worked with an extension team since 2023."],
 ["Practice rainfall data, in millimetres: 2021: 1400; 2022: 1350; 2023: 1300; 2024: 1260; 2025: 1200. Annual rainfall has been decreasing over these five observations. It has fallen by 200 millimetres overall. The decline has continued since 2021, although five annual totals alone cannot establish a long-term climate trend.", "rainfall=precipitação|decrease=diminuir|overall=no total|annual=anual|decline=queda|observation=observação", "A precipitação vem diminuindo nessas cinco observações.", "Rainfall has been decreasing over these five observations."],
 ["Our six-month rotation project begins in January. We are going to map the plots in the first week. In February, the team will be preparing the planting areas. By the end of March, we will have planted all demonstration plots. In April, we will be collecting field observations. By the end of June, we will have completed the first comparison report.", "rotation=rotação|plot=parcela|milestone=marco|by=até (prazo)|comparison=comparação|complete=concluir", "Até o fim de março, teremos plantado todas as parcelas.", "By the end of March, we will have planted all the plots."],
 ["If the soil is too wet, we will postpone field traffic. If the supplier confirms delivery, we will arrange unloading. If the forecast changes, we will review the work plan. If the storage inspection identifies a fault, we will contact the responsible technician before use.", "postpone=adiar|field traffic=tráfego no campo|arrange=organizar|unloading=descarregamento|fault=falha|review=revisar", "Se a previsão mudar, revisaremos o plano de trabalho.", "If the forecast changes, we will review the work plan."],
 ["The inspection record shows a damaged electrical cable near the store. We must keep people away and report it immediately under the site's safety procedure. We should review how equipment is checked before use. The damage might have occurred during yesterday's delivery, but we cannot be certain without more evidence.", "cable=cabo|immediately=imediatamente|procedure=procedimento|evidence=evidência|certain=certo|inspection=inspeção", "O dano pode ter ocorrido durante a entrega, mas não temos certeza.", "The damage might have occurred during the delivery, but we aren't certain."],
 ["Employees have to record their arrival. Contractors must sign in with the supervisor. Both groups are allowed to use the marked visitor parking area. Neither group is allowed to enter the restricted store without permission. Last year, contractors could sign in at the gate, but now they have to use the office.", "contractor=prestador de serviço|restricted=restrito|permission=permissão|sign in=registrar entrada|both=ambos|neither=nenhum dos dois", "No ano passado, eles podiam registrar a entrada na porteira.", "Last year, they could sign in at the gate."],
 ["The planting operation failed after several delays. We had ordered the seed too late, so it arrived after the planned date. The team had not checked the drill before starting, and a mechanical fault stopped work. Rain then prevented field access because the soil had already become saturated.", "delay=atraso|drill=semeadora|fault=falha|saturated=saturado|prevent=impedir|access=acesso", "Não tínhamos verificado a semeadora antes de começar.", "We hadn't checked the seed drill before starting."],
 ["Supplier Ana wrote that seed costs 500 reais a bag and delivery takes five days. Consultant Paulo advised checking the field records before changing the plan. The warehouse manager said that ten empty pallets were available. I told the team that Ana had quoted 500 reais per bag, Paulo had recommended a records check, and the warehouse could provide ten pallets.", "quote=cotar|advise=aconselhar|warehouse=armazém|pallet=palete|recommend=recomendar|available=disponível", "A fornecedora disse que a entrega levaria cinco dias.", "The supplier said that delivery would take five days."],
 ["Could you tell me which quality specifications you require? Do you know when the next delivery window opens? I was wondering whether you accept smaller shipments. Would you mind explaining how your team checks the samples?", "specification=especificação|delivery window=janela de entrega|shipment=remessa|accept=aceitar|require=exigir|sample=amostra", "Você poderia me dizer quais especificações exige?", "Could you tell me which specifications you require?"],
 ["It is a machine that plants seeds in rows. It is a person who advises farmers about crops. It is a place where grain is stored. It is a tool which measures moisture. It is a process that separates mature grain from the crop. Answers: seed drill, agronomist, grain store, moisture meter, harvesting.", "row=linha|advise=orientar|store=armazenar|measure=medir|separate=separar|mature=maduro", "É uma ferramenta que mede a umidade.", "It is a tool that measures moisture."],
 ["For this demonstration, I recommend the locally approved cover crop listed in our field plan. The plot has bare soil, so surface protection is a priority. We also need an option compatible with the next crop. We will monitor establishment so that we can compare coverage before making a wider recommendation. Therefore, this is a small monitored trial, rather than a farm-wide prescription.", "cover crop=planta de cobertura|bare=descoberto|coverage=cobertura|compatible=compatível|trial=ensaio|establishment=estabelecimento", "Monitoraremos o estabelecimento para que possamos comparar a cobertura.", "We will monitor establishment so that we can compare coverage."],
 ["Extension note for this practice: Before a demonstration visit, confirm the grower's objective. Gather recent field records, check access and agree on the questions to investigate. During the visit, separate observations from possible explanations. Record the location and date of photographs. Afterward, summarize what was observed, what remains uncertain and who will take each next step. My briefing: The note explains how to organize an evidence-based visit. Its main recommendations are to prepare with the grower, record observations consistently, and agree on follow-up responsibilities. A photograph alone does not establish a diagnosis.", "grower=produtor|gather=reunir|afterward=depois|follow-up=acompanhamento|uncertain=incerto|briefing=informe", "O texto recomenda separar observações de possíveis explicações.", "The text recommends separating observations from possible explanations."],
 ["If we had ordered the seed earlier, planting might have started on time. If the team had checked the pump, they could have identified the fault sooner. If we had confirmed the delivery address, the truck would not have gone to the wrong farm.", "earlier=mais cedo|sooner=mais cedo|fault=falha|address=endereço|confirm=confirmar|on time=no prazo", "Se tivéssemos confirmado o endereço, o caminhão não teria ido à fazenda errada.", "If we had confirmed the address, the truck wouldn't have gone to the wrong farm."],
 ["The practice case has four clues: leaf damage appeared after a cold night; low areas were most affected; no insects were found during the first inspection; neighbouring sheltered plants were less affected. Cold injury might have contributed because damage was greater in exposed areas. Insects could still have been involved, although the inspection found none. A nutritional issue may also be possible, but the sudden timing makes that explanation less convincing. Further inspection is needed.", "clue=indício|sheltered=protegido|injury=dano|contribute=contribuir|convincing=convincente|further=adicional", "O frio pode ter contribuído, mas é necessária outra inspeção.", "Cold weather might have contributed, but further inspection is needed."],
 ["In this fictional handling procedure, produce is received at the designated area. Each lot is identified and its condition is recorded. Damaged items are separated according to the site's protocol. Accepted produce is placed in the specified storage area. Finally, the records are checked before dispatch.", "produce=produtos agrícolas|lot=lote|dispatch=expedição|designated=designado|condition=condição|handling=manuseio", "Cada lote é identificado e sua condição é registrada.", "Each lot is identified and its condition is recorded."],
 ["Could we move the delivery to Thursday? Our unloading team will not be available on Wednesday. If Thursday works for you, we can accept the smaller shipment first. Would that help with your route? Agreed: the first shipment will arrive on Thursday before ten, and we will confirm the remaining quantity by email.", "shipment=remessa|remaining=restante|unloading=descarregamento|agreed=combinado|concession=concessão|route=rota", "Se quinta-feira funcionar, podemos aceitar a remessa menor primeiro.", "If Thursday works, we can accept the smaller shipment first."],
 ["I support a limited precision-agriculture pilot. In this practice budget, mapping costs 8,000 reais and the farm has 20 comparable plots, allowing a controlled comparison. Better records could help us identify variation. You argue that the equipment is expensive; I agree, which is why I propose renting it for the pilot. You also mention staff training. That is a valid concern, so the budget should include training before any expansion.", "precision agriculture=agricultura de precisão|variation=variação|rent=alugar|concern=preocupação|controlled=controlado|expansion=expansão", "É uma preocupação válida, então o orçamento deveria incluir treinamento.", "That is a valid concern, so the budget should include training."],
 ["Practice case study: A cooperative introduced a shared visit log. Reports became easier to compare, but some growers found the form too long. The case argues that consistent records help coordination only when the system is practical. One implication is that the team should agree on a small set of essential fields. Another is that growers need a way to explain unusual situations. How did the cooperative measure the time needed to complete each record?", "visit log=registro de visitas|consistent=consistente|implication=implicação|essential=essencial|unusual=incomum|measure=medir", "Uma implicação é que a equipe deveria concordar sobre os campos essenciais.", "One implication is that the team should agree on the essential fields."],
 ["I recommend Ana for the farm-supervisor role. She organized weekly schedules for a team of six, which shows planning ability. She resolved a delivery delay by coordinating with two suppliers, demonstrating communication. She also introduced a simple inspection log, which improved record completeness in our practice case. She has limited experience with larger budgets, so she would benefit from financial mentoring.", "strength=ponto forte|schedule=cronograma|resolve=resolver|completeness=completude|mentoring=mentoria|role=cargo", "Ela organizou os horários de seis pessoas, o que demonstra capacidade de planejamento.", "She organized schedules for six people, which shows planning ability."],
 ["Subject: Correction requested — seed delivery invoice 104\nDear Ana,\nI am writing about invoice 104, issued for our seed delivery on 12 October. The invoice lists twenty bags, but our signed delivery note records eighteen. Both the receiving team and the driver confirmed the quantity when the truck arrived.\nCould you please check your dispatch record and send us a corrected invoice? I have attached a copy of the delivery note and highlighted the relevant entry. The agreed price per bag is unchanged; the correction concerns only the quantity and the resulting total.\nWe would appreciate receiving the updated document by Friday so that our finance team can process it within this payment cycle. Please let me know if you need any further information or a clearer copy of the attachment.\nThank you for your help.\nKind regards,\nJoão", "invoice=nota fiscal / fatura|delivery note=comprovante de entrega|issued=emitido|quantity=quantidade|attachment=anexo|payment cycle=ciclo de pagamento", "Você poderia verificar o registro de expedição e enviar uma fatura corrigida?", "Could you check the dispatch record and send a corrected invoice?"],
 ["Our practice case shows irrigation energy costs rising from 10,000 to 13,000 reais per month. First, we could inspect the system: this has a low initial cost but may not address the whole increase. Second, we could adjust scheduling after checking crop requirements and tariffs; this needs reliable data and technical approval. Third, we could replace inefficient equipment, which may reduce use but requires capital. I recommend an initial technical assessment because we need to understand the cause before committing to a major purchase.", "tariff=tarifa|initial=inicial|capital=capital|assessment=avaliação|reliable=confiável|increase=aumento", "Precisamos entender a causa antes de assumir uma compra grande.", "We need to understand the cause before committing to a major purchase."],
 ["Practice data per hectare: manual harvesting costs 2,000 reais, takes 80 labour hours, produces 20 units and has 2% recorded loss. Mechanized harvesting costs 1,500 reais, takes 12 hours, produces 20 units and has 4% recorded loss. Mechanization is cheaper and faster in this case. Output is the same, but recorded loss is higher. I recommend a field trial before expansion because terrain and product quality may change the result.", "mechanized=mecanizado|output=produção|recorded=registrado|loss=perda|terrain=terreno|trial=ensaio", "A produção é igual, mas a perda registrada é maior.", "Output is the same, but recorded loss is higher."],
 ["Today I will explain our field-visit recording practice. First, we agree on the visit's purpose. Second, we record observations with a date and location. Third, we agree on the next actions and the person responsible. This structure helps the team retrieve information. To conclude, clear records support follow-up when they remain brief and useful. Question: Who checks the report? Answer: The responsible adviser. Question: What if the cause is uncertain? Answer: We record the uncertainty and the next investigation step.", "purpose=propósito|retrieve=recuperar|responsible=responsável|adviser=orientador técnico|uncertainty=incerteza|conclude=concluir", "Para concluir, registros claros ajudam no acompanhamento.", "To conclude, clear records support follow-up."],
 ["My goal is to become an extension coordinator within three years. By the end of year one, I plan to complete a supervised field project. In year two, I want to lead monthly team briefings. By the end of year three, I intend to apply for a coordination role. If no suitable position opens, I will seek a smaller project-lead role and continue developing my management skills.", "goal=meta|supervised=supervisionado|apply=candidatar-se|suitable=adequado|intend=pretender|milestone=marco", "Se não surgir uma vaga adequada, procurarei uma função de liderança menor.", "If no suitable position opens, I will seek a smaller leadership role."],
];
const B2 = [
 ["In the practice timeline, the team had been operating heavy equipment on wet ground for six weeks before the restriction was introduced in April. Surface pooling had been increasing during March, while staff had been reporting slower infiltration. Those observations are consistent with a worsening problem, but they do not establish a single cause. The intervention reduced traffic; subsequent monitoring is needed to assess whether soil conditions improved.", "pooling=empoçamento|infiltration=infiltração|restriction=restrição|subsequent=posterior|consistent with=compatível com|worsening=agravamento", "A equipe vinha relatando infiltração mais lenta antes da intervenção.", "The team had been reporting slower infiltration before the intervention."],
 ["We would like to renew the service agreement, provided that coverage remains reliable. Our constraints are a 5% budget ceiling, a two-day response window and monthly reporting. Data confidentiality is non-negotiable. If we had received the last reports sooner, we would be more comfortable with a longer renewal now. We could accept a shorter initial term in exchange for a review after three months. Can we confirm those conditions before discussing the final price?", "provided that=desde que|ceiling=teto|response window=prazo de resposta|non-negotiable=inegociável|renewal=renovação|in exchange for=em troca de", "Poderíamos aceitar um prazo inicial menor em troca de uma revisão.", "We could accept a shorter initial term in exchange for a review."],
 ["By June of year one, we expect to have completed the feasibility assessment. During the following quarter, the team will be reviewing permits and supplier proposals. By December, we aim to have installed the pilot, subject to approval. Throughout year two, we will be monitoring performance before any expansion. Delayed permits could shift the schedule, and unexpected energy costs could affect the business case. These are conditional planning milestones, rather than guaranteed outcomes.", "feasibility=viabilidade|permit=licença|subject to=sujeito a|throughout=durante todo|business case=justificativa econômica|milestone=marco", "Até dezembro, pretendemos ter instalado o piloto, sujeito à aprovação.", "By December, we aim to have installed the pilot, subject to approval."],
 ["Neutral: We should review the evidence before expanding. Emphatic: Only after reviewing the evidence should we consider expansion.\nNeutral: The missing records concern us most. Emphatic: It is the missing records that concern us most.\nNeutral: We cannot ignore the cost increase. Emphatic: Under no circumstances should we ignore the cost increase.\nNeutral: Training matters as well as equipment. Emphatic: Not only equipment but also training requires investment.\nThe revisions foreground sequence, concern, urgency and scope without introducing new factual claims.", "foreground=destacar|scope=escopo|urgency=urgência|claim=afirmação|emphasis=ênfase|sequence=sequência", "Somente depois de revisar as evidências deveríamos considerar a expansão.", "Only after reviewing the evidence should we consider expansion."],
 ["Audit update — practice case\nThree storage records were unavailable during the inspection. It has been reported by the supervisor that the documents were moved during an office renovation; this explanation has not yet been verified. The receiving log was checked against the available delivery notes, and two quantities could not be reconciled. No conclusion about deliberate misconduct can be drawn from the missing records alone. The documents should be retrieved before the review is closed. Any discrepancy must be documented and discussed with the responsible staff. A follow-up meeting has been scheduled for Friday. Until the additional evidence is examined, the findings should be treated as provisional and the distinction between observed facts and reported explanations must remain explicit.", "reconcile=conciliar|misconduct=conduta inadequada|provisional=provisório|discrepancy=divergência|retrieved=recuperado|finding=constatação", "Os documentos deveriam ser recuperados antes de a revisão ser encerrada.", "The documents should be retrieved before the review is closed."],
 ["I wish we had confirmed the storage capacity before harvest. If only we had tested the reporting system earlier. I wish our records were more consistent now, and I wish the supplier would confirm changes in writing. The lesson is to verify practical constraints before committing and to assign responsibility for each confirmation.", "regret=arrependimento|capacity=capacidade|constraint=restrição|commit=assumir compromisso|consistent=consistente|assign=atribuir", "Gostaria que tivéssemos confirmado a capacidade antes da colheita.", "I wish we had confirmed the capacity before harvest."],
 ["Verbose: The team, which was working in the eastern field, recorded the incident. Concise: The team working in the eastern field recorded the incident.\nVerbose: After Ana had checked the labels, she sealed the bags. Concise: Having checked the labels, Ana sealed the bags.\nVerbose: The samples that were collected on Monday were stored separately. Concise: The samples collected on Monday were stored separately.\nVerbose: Because Paulo knew the route, he guided the visitors. Concise: Knowing the route, Paulo guided the visitors.\nVerbose: The report, which was prepared by Maria, lists the limitations. Concise: The report prepared by Maria lists the limitations.", "concise=conciso|seal=lacrar|separately=separadamente|limitation=limitação|agent=agente da ação|chronology=cronologia", "Tendo verificado as etiquetas, Ana lacrou os sacos.", "Having checked the labels, Ana sealed the bags."],
 ["Ana warned that the delivery date might slip. Paulo objected to starting without confirmed materials. Maria recommended a smaller pilot, while João offered to revise the budget. The group agreed that João would submit the revision by Thursday and that Ana would confirm supply before Friday's decision. No one approved a full rollout; that decision remains pending.", "warn=alertar|object=opor-se|recommend=recomendar|rollout=implantação ampla|pending=pendente|attribution=atribuição", "Paulo se opôs a começar sem materiais confirmados.", "Paulo objected to starting without confirmed materials."],
 ["Awkward → natural report wording: do a decision → make a decision; do a harvest → carry out a harvest; strong rain → heavy rain; make a research → conduct research; win experience → gain experience; do an agreement → reach an agreement; high costs grow → costs rise; take attention → pay attention; make a loss → incur a loss; big demand → strong demand.\nUse the collocations in context: We conducted research after heavy rain disrupted harvesting. The team gained experience, reached an agreement and made a decision to monitor rising costs. Strong demand did not prevent the business from incurring a loss.", "conduct research=realizar pesquisa|heavy rain=chuva forte|gain experience=ganhar experiência|reach an agreement=chegar a um acordo|incur a loss=sofrer prejuízo|pay attention=prestar atenção", "A equipe realizou uma pesquisa e chegou a um acordo.", "The team conducted research and reached an agreement."],
 ["The practice proposal compares a treated plot on a hill with an untreated plot in a valley, using one observation per plot. Two limitations weaken the inference: treatment is confounded with location, and there is no replication. I recommend comparing treatments within comparable blocks and collecting repeated, consistently timed measurements. Even then, conclusions should be restricted to the tested conditions. A practical demonstration may be useful, but this design cannot establish a general treatment effect.", "confounded=confundido|replication=repetição experimental|inference=inferência|block=bloco|restrict=restringir|treatment=tratamento", "O tratamento está confundido com o local, e não há repetição experimental.", "Treatment is confounded with location, and there is no replication."],
 ["Our proposed investment is a 20,000-real monitoring pilot. I will address the problem, the evidence and the decision conditions. The practice records show ten unplanned stoppages, but their causes differ, so a sensor purchase alone is not yet justified. The pilot will compare detection time on two matched lines over one season. We should proceed only if the supplier accepts the evaluation criteria and the team can maintain the equipment. Question: What if savings are smaller than expected? We would stop expansion. Question: Why not buy now? The current evidence cannot establish value. Question: Who is responsible? The operations lead owns the evaluation, with independent record checks.", "matched=pareado|stoppage=parada|evaluation=avaliação|maintain=manter|independent=independente|justify=justificar", "Deveríamos prosseguir somente se o fornecedor aceitar os critérios de avaliação.", "We should proceed only if the supplier accepts the evaluation criteria."],
 ["Proposal: A field demonstration of a shared visit record\nPurpose\nThis proposal requests approval for a small demonstration to evaluate whether a shorter visit record improves the completeness and usefulness of field information. The demonstration will focus on communication and follow-up; it will not test the agronomic effectiveness of any treatment.\nMethod\nSix volunteer growers and two extension advisers will use a common form for eight weeks. Before the demonstration begins, the team will agree on essential fields: visit purpose, dated observations, uncertainties, next actions and responsible people. Advisers will receive a short orientation and use fictional examples to check their understanding.\nDuring the first two weeks, participants will record their current reporting time and identify information that is difficult to retrieve. For the following six weeks, they will use the shorter form. The coordinator will check a sample of records weekly and document missing entries without adding information retrospectively.\nBudget\nThe proposed budget is 3,000 reais: 1,200 for adviser preparation, 800 for grower orientation, 600 for coordination and 400 as a contingency. These figures are planning assumptions and require confirmation before approval. Existing devices will be used; no equipment purchase is proposed.\nRisks and safeguards\nParticipation may decline during busy periods. The team will therefore agree on suitable dates and keep the form brief. Inconsistent interpretation is another risk, addressed through shared examples and a weekly clarification log. Access to individual records will be limited to the authorized participants, and the final report will use aggregated results.\nIndicators and decision\nThe evaluation will compare median completion time, the proportion of records containing all essential fields, and the number of follow-up actions with a named owner. Participants will also explain whether the form helps their work. The demonstration should continue only if records become more complete without an unacceptable increase in reporting time. At the final meeting, the coordinator will present the evidence, limitations and a recommendation to revise, expand or discontinue the form. Approval is requested for this limited demonstration, with wider adoption dependent on the recorded results.", "contingency=contingência|retrospectively=retrospectivamente|aggregated=agregado|proportion=proporção|safeguard=salvaguarda|discontinue=descontinuar", "A adoção mais ampla dependerá dos resultados registrados.", "Wider adoption will depend on the recorded results."],
 ["'We need to get the ball rolling' means we need to start. 'Let's touch base' means let's exchange an update. 'That is a bottleneck' means that point limits progress. 'We need a level playing field' means we need fair conditions. 'Let's go back to square one' means let's restart the planning. 'That is a long shot' means it is unlikely to succeed. In a technical safety instruction or an unfamiliar international group, a plain explanation may be clearer than an idiom.", "bottleneck=gargalo|fair=justo|unlikely=improvável|plain=simples e direto|restart=recomeçar|idiom=expressão idiomática", "Precisamos começar. Vamos trocar uma atualização.", "We need to start. Let's exchange an update."],
 ["I recommend a limited sustainability pilot, subject to measured results. Our fictional budget is 12,000 reais, with a maximum exposure agreed in advance. You object that returns are uncertain; I agree, so we should define a stopping rule. You question the team's capacity; the pilot should use two trained operators rather than expand immediately. You argue that monitoring adds administration; a short shared log can record the essential indicators. These safeguards do not guarantee success, but they make the decision more accountable.", "stopping rule=regra de interrupção|exposure=exposição|accountable=responsabilizável|return=retorno|safeguard=salvaguarda|subject to=sujeito a", "Essas medidas não garantem sucesso, mas tornam a decisão mais responsável.", "These measures don't guarantee success, but they make the decision more accountable."],
 ["Practice policy excerpt: 'Applications should include evidence of water availability, a realistic maintenance plan and consultation with affected users.' The first implied concern is that a project might promise more water than is available; the phrase 'evidence of water availability' supports this reading. The second is that infrastructure might fail without upkeep, suggested by 'maintenance plan'. The third is that other users could be affected, reflected in the consultation requirement. These are defensible interpretations, not proof of the policy writer's unstated intentions.", "excerpt=trecho|availability=disponibilidade|upkeep=manutenção|affected=afetado|defensible=defensável|implied=implícito", "Esta é uma interpretação defensável, e não uma prova da intenção do autor.", "This is a defensible interpretation, not proof of the writer's intention."],
 ["We value our relationship and would like to discuss a concern before the next delivery. In our practice records, three of the last five lots fell outside the agreed moisture tolerance. Could we review the measurement method together and agree on a corrective plan? We are not assuming the cause. However, future deliveries need to meet the specification. Could you send your proposed actions by Thursday so that we can confirm the next steps?", "tolerance=tolerância|corrective=corretivo|specification=especificação|concern=preocupação|measurement=medição|meet=cumprir", "Poderíamos revisar juntos o método de medição e concordar com um plano corretivo?", "Could we review the measurement method together and agree on a corrective plan?"],
 ["The case presents pressure to reduce labour costs while maintaining worker welfare. From the manager's perspective, an uncompetitive budget threatens the business. From the workers' perspective, shorter paid hours may reduce income or intensify workloads. A responsible decision should examine scheduling, avoidable losses and training before shifting costs onto workers. If trade-offs remain, they should be explicit and discussed with the affected people. A lower unit cost alone is an incomplete measure of success.", "welfare=bem-estar|workload=carga de trabalho|trade-off=contrapartida|avoidable=evitável|unit cost=custo unitário|threaten=ameaçar", "Um custo unitário menor, sozinho, é uma medida incompleta de sucesso.", "A lower unit cost alone is an incomplete measure of success."],
 ["In the optimistic scenario, rainfall remains within our planning range and costs stay stable; we could expand after the pilot. In the baseline scenario, rainfall varies and input costs rise modestly; we would maintain the current area and review reserves. In the adverse scenario, prolonged dry periods coincide with higher costs; we might postpone expansion and reassess crop choices with the technical team. These are conditional scenarios based on explicit assumptions, not weather forecasts or guaranteed financial outcomes.", "baseline=cenário de referência|adverse=adverso|prolonged=prolongado|reserve=reserva|postpone=adiar|assumption=pressuposto", "No cenário adverso, poderíamos adiar a expansão.", "In the adverse scenario, we might postpone expansion."],
 ["Three fictional sources: A trial abstract reports improved record completeness in 12 participating farms but no yield measurement. A market note reports stronger buyer demand for traceability, based on interviews with four buyers. A grower interview describes a useful visit log but says that entry takes too long.\nBriefing: The sources converge on the potential value of better records, while addressing different outcomes. The field trial supports a claim about completeness within a small participating sample; it does not demonstrate an increase in yield. The market note suggests that some buyers value traceability, although four interviews cannot establish market-wide demand. The grower's account adds an operational limitation: the same recording process may become burdensome during busy periods. Taken together, the evidence supports testing a shorter, clearly defined record rather than assuming that more data automatically improves the business. A pilot should measure completion time, record quality and whether a buyer actually uses the information. Growers should help select the essential fields, and the team should document who can access the records. The proposal remains conditional because the sources use different samples and methods, provide no reliable estimate of financial return, and may overrepresent participants already interested in record keeping.", "converge=convergir|traceability=rastreabilidade|burdensome=oneroso / trabalhoso|overrepresent=sobrerrepresentar|sample=amostra|outcome=resultado", "As fontes convergem sobre o valor potencial de registros melhores.", "The sources converge on the potential value of better records."],
 ["Our agenda is to agree on planting priorities, labour allocation and the next decision date. Ana, could you explain the supply constraint first? Paulo, how would that affect the field team? Maria, we have not heard your view yet. I hear two competing priorities: starting early and avoiding an unsupported workload. Could we separate the decisions we can make today from those requiring more information? We agree that Ana will confirm supply by Wednesday, Paulo will prepare two schedules, and we will decide on Friday. Have I represented everyone's position accurately?", "allocation=alocação|constraint=restrição|competing=concorrente|agenda=pauta|recap=recapitulação|accurately=com precisão", "Podemos separar as decisões de hoje daquelas que exigem mais informações?", "Could we separate today's decisions from those requiring more information?"],
 ["Remark one: 'Wonderful, another last-minute change.' Literally it sounds positive; after a sigh, it may express frustration. A safe response is: 'The change creates extra work. What needs adjusting?' Remark two: 'Well, that went smoothly,' after a delivery problem may be ironic. Ask: 'Which part should we improve?' Remark three: 'You're an early bird today,' may be friendly praise or criticism of lateness, depending on timing and relationship. Do not assume the intended tone; ask neutrally if meaning is unclear.", "remark=comentário|sigh=suspiro|frustration=frustração|ironic=irônico|neutrally=de forma neutra|tone=tom", "Não presuma o tom pretendido; pergunte de forma neutra.", "Don't assume the intended tone; ask neutrally."],
 ["Practice proposal facts: current records are inconsistent; a shorter form costs 3,000 reais to pilot; buying a new system costs 20,000; no reliable saving estimate exists; staff time and data access are unresolved.\nExecutive summary\nThe cooperative needs a consistent and practical way to record field visits. Current records vary in completeness, making it difficult to retrieve observations and follow-up responsibilities. The proposal considers retaining the current process, piloting a shorter shared form or purchasing a new digital system.\nA limited form pilot is the preferred option. Its proposed cost is 3,000 reais, compared with 20,000 for a new system, and it would allow the team to test the essential information requirements before committing to software. The existing evidence identifies incomplete records but does not provide a reliable estimate of financial savings; an investment return should therefore not be assumed.\nThe pilot should measure completion time, the proportion of complete records and the proportion of follow-up actions with a named owner. Staff should document usability problems and clarify who may access individual information.\nThe principal risks are additional administration, inconsistent use and unclear access responsibilities. Approval is requested only for the bounded pilot, with an agreed review date and a stopping rule. Wider adoption should depend on documented improvements that justify the workload and cost.", "bounded=delimitado|retain=manter|principal=principal|justify=justificar|workload=carga de trabalho|proportion=proporção", "Solicita-se aprovação apenas para o piloto delimitado.", "Approval is requested only for the bounded pilot."],
 ["For this fictional supply negotiation, we can accept 500 reais per bag if delivery is confirmed for 12 October. Our quality tolerance is the range stated in the draft specification; we need the measurement method attached. If delivery is more than two working days late, we propose a 2% invoice reduction, subject to review of the wording. In return for a confirmed volume of twenty bags, could you keep the quoted price? Let's record the agreed price, delivery date, quality checks and proposed penalty for professional review before signing.", "clause=cláusula|quoted=cotado|penalty=penalidade|wording=redação|in return for=em troca de|tolerance=tolerância", "Precisamos anexar o método de medição à especificação.", "We need to attach the measurement method to the specification."],
 ["Producer: 'I said the lot would be ready, not that it had passed the buyer's inspection.' Buyer: 'I understood ready to mean cleared for dispatch.' Technician: 'The samples were collected, but the results are pending.'\nMediator: 'Let me check the distinction. The producer means the lot is prepared. The buyer understood that all checks were complete. The technician confirms that results are still pending. Have I represented each position correctly? In Portuguese: O lote está preparado, mas a liberação ainda depende dos resultados. Could we agree that the technician will send the results before anyone confirms dispatch? I will summarize the agreed meaning in both languages and ask each person to confirm.'", "cleared=liberado|dispatch=expedição|pending=pendente|mediate=mediar|distinction=distinção|confirm=confirmar", "O lote está preparado, mas a liberação ainda depende dos resultados.", "The lot is prepared, but clearance still depends on the results."],
];
